      "text": [
        " : سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنْ رَسُولِ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ هَلْ أَوْصَى إِلَى اَلْحَسَنِ وَ اَلْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِمَا اَلسَّلاَمُ مَعَ أَمِيرِ اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ قَالَ \"نَعَمْ\" قُلْتُ وَ هُمَا فِي ذَلِكَ اَلسِّنِّ قَالَ \"نَعَمْ وَ لاَ يَكُونُ لِسِوَاهُمَا فِي أَقَلَّ مِنْ خَمْسِ سِنِينَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5566 - Ali ibn Al-Hakam narrated from Ziyad ibn Abi Al-Hallal, who said:\nI asked Abu Abdullah (as), whether the Messenger of Allah (swt), peace and blessings be upon him and his family, had appointed Al-Hasan (as) and Al-Hussain (as), peace be upon them both, along with the Commander of the Faithful (as), peace be upon him, in his will.\nImam (as) replied: \"Yes.\"\nI asked: \"Even though they were at that young age?\"\nImam (as) said: \"Yes, and this would not be for anyone else under the age of five.\""
        ]
      }
    },
